sheepChat Team is pleased to introduce a new version 1.9.107, which includes many fixes and improvements based on user feedback.
The list of changes includes:

- Parsing improvements for the VK Play platform, with mentions and colored nicknames added;
- Edits and improvements for the TikTok platform, additional debug messages in the notification center;
- Fixed connection to Restream io platform;
- Fixed whitelist in speech synthesis;
- Fixed nickname voicing;
- Added ability to set individual speech synthesis volume to match voices for viewers;
- Fixed device setting for audio output;
- Fixed handling of events in channel settings (donates, followers, in/out chat, etc.);
- Fixes and improvements to the Twitch platform, improved logged in / logged out events;
- Silent mode fix;

We hope that these changes will make using the application even more usable and feature-rich. Download the new version of sheepChat 1.9.107 today and enjoy the updated features!

